{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightmare Class Project is a PSX style 3rd person game where you must survive through each day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions and choices will have an impact on the future of your new school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet ambiguous people (and creatures), collect cosmetics, slide out of your dorm and uncover the secrets of this place, or die trying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Grand Academy of Wizardry welcomes its new students for the year!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graduate and become a great protector of Juwurumun,\u00a0a nation that is getting back on its feet after the attacks of a horrible dragon 300 years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That is, if you can survive through the scholarship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The school director himself defeated that said beast, his establishment has a reputation to uphold, failure is not an option, it's an insult!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But.. this place is clearly evil, will you dare dig into its past?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939400?t=1769183787","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939400/9058eb60e29679c2591ee5253a7bffa02f88ea90/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769183787","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939400/7d70e571a289684ad58f313b11ae08b408c14573/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769183787","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939400/7d70e571a289684ad58f313b11ae08b408c14573/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769183787","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":